### TrackShift API — click "Send Request" above any block (needs the
### "REST Client" extension by Humao). Backend must be running on :8000.

@host = http://localhost:8000

### Root / health check
GET {{host}}/


### ===================== Tyre Intelligence =====================

### Meta — drivers & compounds
GET {{host}}/tyre-intel/meta

### List all stints (grab a stintId from here for the requests below)
GET {{host}}/tyre-intel/stints

### Overview KPIs for the default stint
GET {{host}}/tyre-intel/overview

### Hero: raw vs corrected degradation
GET {{host}}/tyre-intel/degradation

### All laps + validity for the default stint
GET {{host}}/tyre-intel/laps

### Degradation curves filtered by compound
GET {{host}}/tyre-intel/degradation-curve?compound=medium

### Compound comparison table
GET {{host}}/tyre-intel/compare

### Remaining tyre life projection
GET {{host}}/tyre-intel/remaining-life

### Lap forensics — swap driver/lapNumber for ones that exist in /tyre-intel/laps
GET {{host}}/tyre-intel/lap-forensics?driver=REY&lapNumber=20

### Strategy simulator
POST {{host}}/tyre-intel/strategy
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "stintId": "REY-medium-13",
  "nextCompound": "hard",
  "pitLossSeconds": 21.5,
  "horizon": 10
}

### Ask the Race Engineer
POST {{host}}/tyre-intel/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "When should we pit?"
}

### Regenerate the mock session (new random seed)
POST {{host}}/tyre-intel/session/regenerate

### Home page demo bundle
GET {{host}}/tyre-intel/demo


### ===================== Race Ops (original, unchanged) =====================

### Live race state
GET {{host}}/race/state

### Telemetry buffer
GET {{host}}/telemetry

### Pit strategy recommendation
GET {{host}}/strategy

### Competitors
GET {{host}}/competitors

### Monte Carlo strategy simulation
POST {{host}}/strategy/simulate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tyre": "medium",
  "position": 2,
  "weather": "dry",
  "scProbability": 0.15,
  "iterations": 500
}
